---
// Introduction.astro
---

<section id="about" class="py-16 sm:py-24 md:py-32 border-t border-subtle bg-surface-1/40 relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      
      <!-- Section Tag -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-8">
        <span class="w-8 h-[2px] bg-[#ff4500]"></span>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-dim uppercase">Core Philosophy</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Headline -->
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-main leading-[1.18] mb-10">
        Attention Is Where Everything Begins.
      </h2>

      <!-- Body Copy -->
      <div class="space-y-6 text-lg sm:text-xl text-muted font-normal leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Your potential customers see hundreds of messages every day. Most get ignored. The difference isn't always the product. Sometimes, it's how you capture their attention.
        </p>
        <p class="text-main font-medium">
          At MyHookLab, we focus on creating hooks that make people stop, notice, and want to know more.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Minimalist Lab Principles Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-16 pt-12 border-t border-subtle">
        
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface-card border border-subtle hover:border-zinc-400 dark:hover:border-zinc-600 transition-all duration-200">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold text-[#ff4500] mb-2">01 / The Premise</div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-main mb-2">The 0.4s Threshold</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed">
            Human perception filters digital feeds in fractions of a second. If the opening fails, the offer never gets seen.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface-card border border-subtle hover:border-zinc-400 dark:hover:border-zinc-600 transition-all duration-200">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold text-[#ff4500] mb-2">02 / The Method</div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-main mb-2">Pattern Interrupts</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed">
            We break familiar cognitive loops with unconventional angles, precision framing, and curiosity-driven hooks.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface-card border border-subtle hover:border-zinc-400 dark:hover:border-zinc-600 transition-all duration-200">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold text-[#ff4500] mb-2">03 / The Outcome</div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-main mb-2">Intentional Curiosity</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed">
            Attention without retention is vanity. Our hooks are engineered to pull the right audience deeper into your story.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

